          },
          "code": "GENERATE_DISPLAY_WIDGET",
          "id": "1770659703086",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770659703087_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use this version to prevent rows from being dropped:\n\nAs a CX Analytics expert, create a MessageListWidget for the opportunities in `{{$context.$variables.ListofOpportunities}}`.\n\nImportant:\n\n* Create **one row for every opportunity** in `ListofOpportunities`.\n* **Do not filter, skip, deduplicate, or rank away rows**.\n* **Preserve the same order** as the input list.\n* If a field is missing for a row, use an empty string or the closest available value. Do not drop the row.\n* The output must contain exactly the same number of rows as `ListofOpportunities`.\n\nDo NOT return any title for the MessageListWidget.\nDo NOT return any description for the MessageListWidget.\n\nFor each row, set:\n\nTitle: `Opportunity name`\n\n* Use `opportunity.Name` from the current row.\n\nSubtitle:\n\n* Build dynamically from the first 3 entries in `{{$context.$nodes.GET_DISPLAY_ATTRIBUTES.$output.attributes}}`.\n* For each of the first 3 attributes, get the value of `<normalizedFieldName>` from the current row and apply `<formattingRule>`.\n* Join the formatted values with `|`.\n* Use only the first 3 attributes.\n* Do not add, remove, or modify any values.\n\nSummary:\n\n* Use `recommendedAction`.\n* Keep it short and professional, under 10 words.\n\nStatus:\n\n* Generate exactly 3 concise phrases from `scoreRationale`, separated by commas.\n* Each phrase must be Init Caps / Title Case.\n* Do not use bullets, numbering, lowercase phrases, or extra punctuation.\n* Do not repeat words unless needed for clarity.\n* Keep each phrase short and business-focused.\n\nBadgeText:\n\n* Use `priorityTier`.\n\nPriority: normalize `priorityTier` as follows:\n\n* Critical -> `alert`\n* High -> `warning`\n* Medium or Moderate -> `medium`\n\nFor Critical `riskStatus`, display `rational` exactly as provided, without changes and without adding 'Risk Score'.\n\nDo not include timestamp.\n\nAction logic:\n\n* For each row, set `action` to:\n  `ora.Invoke(\"launchOpportunity\", {\"opportunityId\":\"\"+<opportunityId>})`\n* Replace `<opportunityId>` with `opportunity.OptyId`.\n\nEnsure the widget output includes a row for all 5 opportunities in the input list, even if some fields are missing."
            },
            {
              "id": "1770659703086_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "When generating output, return only the oraInfoDisplay field from the messageListWidget.\nDo not include any additional text, explanations, or formatting outside of this field.\nEnsure the output is exactly the value of oraInfoDisplay and nothing else."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Payload for Recommendations",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let result = {};\ntry {\n  // Access the array of rows safely\n  const rows =  $context.$variables.ListofOpportunities || [];\n\n  const objectAltKeys = rows\n    .map(row => row.opportunity.OptyNumber)\n    .filter(OptyNumber => OptyNumber !== undefined && OptyNumber !== null);\n\n  // Build standardParameters as JSON string\n  const standardParameters = JSON.stringify({\n    objectType: \"OPPORTUNITY\",\n    objectAltKeys: objectAltKeys\n  });\n\n  // Build optionalParameters string as specified\n  const optionalParameters = \"outcomeType = 'RECOMMENDATION' and outcomeReferences[primaryRef='Y']\";\n\n  result = {\n    standardParameters: standardParameters,\n    optionalParameters: optionalParameters\n  };\n} catch (error) {\n  // Fallback empty object on error\n  result = {\n    standardParameters: JSON.stringify({ objectType: \"OPPORTUNITY\", objectAltKeys: [] }),\n    optionalParameters: \"outcomeType IN('RECOMMENDATION') and outcomeReferences[primaryRef='Y']\"\n  };\n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779919922650"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_PAYLOAD_FOR_RECOMMENDATIONS",
          "id": "1779919634947",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
