                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1779773585458_prompt",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are the Opportunity Prioritization Agent.\n\nAttributes for Prioritization:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_ATTRIBUTES_FOR_PRIORITIZATION.$output}}\n\nopportunities:\n{{$context.$input.listOfOpportunities}}\n\nPRIORITIZATION_RULES:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIORITIZATION_RULES.$output}}\n\nTASK:\nScore each opportunity using the prioritization rules. Use all available structured fields plus Opportunity Summary, Opportunity Recommendations, Account Summary, and comments when present. Treat missing expected fields as signal gaps.\n\n\nOUTPUT CONTRACT:\n\n\n* opportunityId: number\n* priorityOrder: number from 0 to 100\n* priorityTier: <Use Tier Mapping based on priorityOrder>\n* scoreRationale: 2 to 3 concise sentences grounded in the provided data\n* recommendedAction: one specific next step for the rep, with a clear time horizon\n\nTIER MAPPING:\n\n* Critical: 80 to 100\n* High: 60 to 79\n* Medium: 35 to 59\n* Monitor: 15 to 34\n* Low: 0 to 14"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "1779773585458_systemPrompt",
                      "name": "systemPrompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Return ONLY valid raw JSON that strictly matches the required array schema/contract.\n\nRules:\n\n* Do not use markdown.\n* Do not wrap the response in code fences.\n* Do not include explanations, comments, notes, prefixes, or suffixes.\n* Do not include any text before or after the JSON.\n* The response must be directly parsable by a standard JSON parser.\n* Ensure all property names and string values use double quotes.\n* Do not include trailing commas.\n* Do not return null unless explicitly allowed by the schema.\n* Preserve the exact response structure and field names defined in the contract.\n* If no records exist, return an empty JSON array: []"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "Return Prioritize Opportunities"
